  "notes": [
    "Almost every file now opens inside Document Vault instead of another program or web browser: older Word (.doc) and RTF documents, OpenDocument text and presentations, saved web pages (.mht), multi-page TIFF scans, iPhone photos (.heic), SVG drawings and more Office, audio and video formats.",
    "PDFs, audio and video of any size open in the app. Long PDFs show their first pages straight away, and videos can be skipped through without loading the whole file.",
    "Older Word documents and OpenDocument files are now searched by the words inside them, not only by name.",
    "The Web browser page uses the whole window."
